{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-horizon-conformal-invariance","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:horizon-conformal-invariance","kind":"proposition","title":"Conformal invariance at the jet horizon","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-aeon","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-observation"],"cites":["references/penrose2010"],"tags":["jet-horizon","conformal-invariance","aeon","observability","degree-zero"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.horizon_conformal_invariance","text":"horizon-conformal-invariance.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:horizon-conformal-invariance\"></a><p><em>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{H}</code> be a jet horizon  in an affine chart <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">U</code>. Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A_0 \\hookrightarrow A_1 \\hookrightarrow A_2 \\hookrightarrow \\cdots</code> denote the brane tower.</em></p>\n<p><em>The boundary datum <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\partial\\mathcal{A} = (A_1/A_0, A_2/A_0)|_{\\mathcal{H}}</code> that survives the horizon is invariant under rescaling of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A_0</code>. For any <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda \\in \\mathcal{O}(U)^{\\times}</code>:</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  (A_1 / \\lambda A_0, A_2 / \\lambda A_0)\\big|_{\\mathcal{H}}\n  = \n  (A_1 / A_0, A_2 / A_0)\\big|_{\\mathcal{H}}.</code></pre>\n<p><em>Consequently, the boundary datum depends only on the conformal class of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A_0</code> (its zero locus), and not on the specific generator of the horizon ideal <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{h}</code>.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/horizon-conformal-invariance.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"22.12.22","page":"b/prop-horizon-conformal-invariance","qa":{"counts":{"pass":87,"fail":0,"warn":2,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":74},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.InformationTheory.JetHorizon.horizon_conformal_invariance","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/InformationTheory/JetHorizon.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
